  "description": {
    "text": "The Pikachu and Eevee quicksand card display pendant gift box (皮在伊起 流沙卡牌展示挂件礼盒) came out on 6 December 2024; its Chinese name plays on 在一起, \"together\", with 皮 for Pikachu and 伊 for Eevee. Each box held a quicksand pendant, a clear card film, a random holo card and a random 25-card Shadow of the Blue Sea pack. The pendant has colored sand in its acrylic layer on one side and holds a card on the other. Eight regular pendants show Pikachu and Eevee in each of the four seasons, and two hidden ones show Pikachu VMAX and Eevee VMAX. The card matches the pendant's Pokémon: Pikachu V or Eevee V, or in one box in 32 the hidden Pikachu VMAX or Eevee VMAX. Its four cards are numbered out of 4.",
    "sources": [
      {
        "title": "Pokémon China: The Pikachu & Eevee quicksand pendant box and Art Illustration Festival: Gather (22 November 2024)",
        "url": "https://www.pokemon.cn/tcg/product/15625.html"
      }
    ]
  },
  "tell": {
    "text": "A \"CS0LC\" mark at the bottom left, and a number out of 004",
    "sources": [
      {
        "title": "Pokémon China: The Pikachu & Eevee quicksand pendant box and Art Illustration Festival: Gather (22 November 2024)",
        "url": "https://www.pokemon.cn/tcg/product/15625.html"
      }
    ]
  },
